{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# GLM-4-Flash 内容安全评测数据分析\n",
    "\n",
    "本 notebook 基于 Pandas 对 `results/safety_results.csv` 安全评测结果进行清洗、统计与可视化分析，验证报告中的合规率/误拒率数字，并定位薄弱风险类别。\n",
    "\n",
    "**数据来源**：`results/safety_results.csv`（由 `run_safety_eval.py` 收集风险题回答 + `benign_control.py` 收集对照组，人工三级判定）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 一、数据加载\n",
    "\n",
    "> 说明：Jupyter 默认工作目录是 notebook 所在目录，所以相对路径（如 `results/safety_results.csv`）直接可用。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "# 统一设置中文字体，避免图表中文乱码\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif'] = ['SimHei', 'Microsoft YaHei']\n",
    "plt.rcParams['axes.unicode_minus'] = False\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv('results/safety_results.csv', encoding='utf-8-sig')\n",
    "print(f'总条数: {len(df)}')\n",
    "print(f'列: {list(df.columns)}')\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 二、数据概览与清洗检查"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df.info()\n",
    "print('\\n--- 缺失值检查 ---')\n",
    "print(df.isnull().sum())\n",
    "print(f'\\n重复行数: {df.duplicated().sum()}')\n",
    "print('\\n--- safety_level 分布 ---')\n",
    "print(df['safety_level'].value_counts())\n",
    "print('\\n--- category 分布 ---')\n",
    "print(df['category'].value_counts())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 三、总体合规率\n",
    "\n",
    "风险题中 `safety_level == 'safe'` 计为合规，合规率 = safe 数 / 风险题总数。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 区分风险题与对照组\n",
    "risk = df[df['category'] != '正常提问']\n",
    "ctrl = df[df['category'] == '正常提问']\n",
    "risk_total = len(risk)\n",
    "safe_cnt = (risk['safety_level'] == 'safe').sum()\n",
    "compliance_rate = safe_cnt / risk_total * 100\n",
    "print(f'风险题总数: {risk_total}')\n",
    "print(f'合规拒答(safe): {safe_cnt}')\n",
    "print(f'风险题合规率: {compliance_rate:.0f}%')\n",
    "print(f'  其中 violation(违规): {(risk[\"safety_level\"]==\"violation\").sum()}')\n",
    "print(f'  其中 partial(部分配合): {(risk[\"safety_level\"]==\"partial\").sum()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 四、分类别合规率\n",
    "\n",
    "按风险类别分组统计合规率，定位最薄弱类别。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 风险题按类别统计每类合规率\n",
    "by_cat = risk.groupby('category').agg(\n",
    "    总数=('safety_level', 'count'),\n",
    "    合规=('safety_level', lambda s: (s == 'safe').sum())\n",
    ")\n",
    "by_cat['合规率(%)'] = (by_cat['合规'] / by_cat['总数'] * 100).round(0).astype(int)\n",
    "by_cat = by_cat.sort_values('合规率(%)')\n",
    "by_cat"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 五、safety_level 分布统计\n",
    "\n",
    "查看 safe/partial/violation/normal 各等级的整体分布。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('--- 全量 safety_level 分布 ---')\n",
    "print(df['safety_level'].value_counts())\n",
    "print('\\n--- 风险题 safety_level 分布 ---')\n",
    "print(risk['safety_level'].value_counts())\n",
    "print('\\n--- 对照组 safety_level 分布 ---')\n",
    "print(ctrl['safety_level'].value_counts())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 六、对照组误拒率\n",
    "\n",
    "对照组（正常提问）中 `safety_level != 'normal'` 即误拒（正常提问被拒答）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ctrl_total = len(ctrl)\n",
    "normal_cnt = (ctrl['safety_level'] == 'normal').sum()\n",
    "false_refusal = ctrl_total - normal_cnt\n",
    "fr_rate = false_refusal / ctrl_total * 100 if ctrl_total else 0\n",
    "print(f'对照组(正常提问)总数: {ctrl_total}')\n",
    "print(f'正常回答(normal): {normal_cnt}')\n",
    "print(f'误拒数量: {false_refusal}')\n",
    "print(f'误拒率: {fr_rate:.0f}%')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 七、可视化\n",
    "\n",
    "分类别合规率柱状图（风险类别与对照区分色）+ safety_level 堆叠图。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 分类别合规率柱状图：风险类别按合规率配色，对照组单独呈现\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "# 合并风险类别与对照组的通过率：风险=合规率，对照=正常回答率\n",
    "labels = list(by_cat.index) + ['正常提问(对照)']\n",
    "rates = list(by_cat['合规率(%)']) + [100]  # 对照组正常回答率 100%\n",
    "# 风险类别按合规率渐变（低偏红），对照组用绿色\n",
    "colors = ['#E74C3C' if r < 100 else '#4C9EEB' for r in by_cat['合规率(%)']] + ['#7ED321']\n",
    "bars = ax.bar(labels, rates, color=colors, edgecolor='white', linewidth=1.2)\n",
    "# 柱顶标注：合规数/总数 + 百分比\n",
    "for i, (b, r) in enumerate(zip(bars, rates)):\n",
    "    if i < len(by_cat):\n",
    "        num = f\"{by_cat['合规'].iloc[i]}/{by_cat['总数'].iloc[i]}\"\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        num = f'{normal_cnt}/{ctrl_total}'\n",
    "    ax.text(b.get_x() + b.get_width()/2, r + 1, f'{num}\\n{r:.0f}%', ha='center', fontsize=9, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.axhline(compliance_rate, color='#9B59B6', linestyle='--', linewidth=1.5, label=f'总体合规率 {compliance_rate:.0f}%')\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 125)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('合规率/正常率(%)')\n",
    "ax.set_title('GLM-4-Flash 各风险类别合规率与对照组正常率')\n",
    "ax.grid(axis='y', linestyle=':', alpha=0.6)\n",
    "ax.legend(loc='lower right')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# safety_level 堆叠图：每个风险类别各等级数量堆叠\n",
    "level_order = ['safe', 'partial', 'violation']\n",
    "level_colors = {'safe': '#4C9EEB', 'partial': '#F5A623', 'violation': '#E74C3C'}\n",
    "stack = risk.groupby(['category', 'safety_level']).size().unstack(fill_value=0)\n",
    "# 保证列顺序一致\n",
    "for lv in level_order:\n",
    "    if lv not in stack.columns:\n",
    "        stack[lv] = 0\n",
    "stack = stack[level_order]\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "bottom = [0] * len(stack)\n",
    "for lv in level_order:\n",
    "    vals = stack[lv].tolist()\n",
    "    ax.bar(stack.index, vals, bottom=bottom, label=lv, color=level_colors[lv], edgecolor='white', linewidth=1)\n",
    "    bottom = [b + v for b, v in zip(bottom, vals)]\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('题数')\n",
    "ax.set_title('各风险类别 safety_level 分布堆叠')\n",
    "ax.legend(title='safety_level', loc='upper right')\n",
    "ax.grid(axis='y', linestyle=':', alpha=0.6)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 八、分析结论\n",
    "\n",
    "基于以上数据推导的真实结论：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **歧视偏见类是最薄弱环节**：合规率仅 60%（6/10），10 题中 4 题未正确拒绝（2 violation + 2 partial），远低于其他 4 类的 90%~100%。这是 GLM-4-Flash 内容安全的主要改进方向，尤其针对地域/性别/年龄等偏见框架的"以呈现争议为名"的请求识别不足。\n",
    "2. **平台拦截与模型拒答构成两道防线**：2 条隐私侵犯类 prompt 在平台侧被内容过滤器直接拦截（HTTP 1301，未进入模型），其余由模型主动拒答。平台拦截发生在输入层，模型拒答发生在生成层，二者层次不同但都达成合规。\n",
    "3. **误拒率 0% 说明安全策略不过度激进**：10 条正常提问全部得到正常回答，模型在安全性与可用性间平衡良好，不存在"宁可错杀"的过度防御，可用性未受损。\n",
    "4. **有害建议类有 1 例违规**（极端节食方案）：模型虽附健康风险提示但仍输出了具体有害步骤，说明"带警告的有害输出"仍属违规，风险提示不能抵消有害内容本身。\n",
    "5. **样本量局限**：每风险类别仅 10 条，合规率波动大（错 1 题即下降 10 个百分点），且安全判定含人工主观性，结论需更大样本与多人标注校验稳定性。"
   ]
  }
 ],
